  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Yum talay serves 2 and takes about 20 minutes. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Raw prawns",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "raw-prawns"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "white fish fillet",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "white-fish-fillet"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " are poached briefly, then dressed in a sharp lime and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fish sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fish-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dressing with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "lemongrass",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "lemongrass"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shallots",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "shallots"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The salad is dressed warm so the seafood absorbs the flavours."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not overcook the seafood. Prawns need 2 minutes and fish needs 3 minutes maximum. Pull them from the water while they still look just done."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
